==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|de|simulieren}}, from {{der|ru|la|simulō}} and {{der|ru|de|-ieren}}, with the Russian suffix {{af|ru|-овать}}. Morphologically симул- + {{af|ru|-и́ровать}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|симули́ровать}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|симули́ровать|both}}

# to [[simulate]]
# to [[feign]] an illness or disability, especially in [[clinical]] or [[legal]] context; to [[malinger]]

====Conjugation====
''imperfective:'' {{ru-conj|impf|2a+p|симули́ровать}} ''perfective:'' {{ru-conj|pf|2a+p|симули́ровать}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|симуля́нт}}
* {{l|ru|симуля́ция}}

{{C|ru|Lying}}
